* {{IPA|en|/tɒm/|a=RP}}
* {{IPA|en|/tɑm/|a=GA}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-Tom.wav|a=Southern England}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɒm|s=1}}

===Etymology 1===
{{etymon|en|id=name|:inh|enm:Thomme|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|Thomme}}. {{U|hypocorism}} of {{m|en|Thomas}}. The dollar-bill sense is from the portrait of {{w|Thomas Jefferson}} featured on it.

====Proper noun====
{{en-prop|+}}

# {{given name|en|male|dimof=Thomas|addl=also used as a formal male [[given name]]}}.
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare King Lear|III|IV|text=Poor '''Tom'''&#39;s a-cold.}}
#* {{RQ:Twain Tom Sawyer|chapter=VI|page=70|passage="Good,—that's a whack. What's your name?"<br>"Becky Thatcher. What's yours? Oh, I know. It's Thomas Sawyer."<br>"That's the name they lick me by. I'm '''Tom''' when I'm good. You call me '''Tom''', will you?"}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1934|author=w:P. G. Wodehouse|title=Right Ho, Jeeves
|passage=What I'm worrying about is what '''Tom''' says when he starts talking."<br>"Uncle '''Tom'''?"<br>"I wish there was something else you could call him except 'Uncle '''Tom'''&#39;," said Aunt Dahlia a little testily. "Every time you do it, I expect to see him turn black and start playing the banjo."}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2008|author=David Park|title=The Truth Commissioner|page=366|isbn=9780747591290
|passage="We're not sure - we were expecting a girl for some reason. But we're thinking of something simple like '''Tom'''."<br>"Thomas?"<br>"No, just '''Tom'''."}}
#* {{RQ:en:CNN|author=Yahya Abou-Ghazala; Curt Devine; Majlie de Puy Kamp; Rene Marsh|title=‘Second American Revolution’: The team behind DOGE’s government overhaul|url=https://www.cnn.com/2025/02/07/politics/musk-doge-staffers-federal-government-downsizing-invs/index.html|date=2025-02-07|passage=At the heart of much of the controversy surrounding DOGE’s review and access to much of the federal government’s financial payment data was the unique pairing of '''Tom''' Krause, a long-time software CEO, and Marko Elez, a 25-year-old recent employee at Musk’s company SpaceX.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20250329025857/https://www.cnn.com/2025/02/07/politics/musk-doge-staffers-federal-government-downsizing-invs/index.html}}
# {{n-g|A nickname for a common man.}} {{defdate|since 1377}}

